# SSH keys — never commit private/public keypairs (e.g. sandbox access keys)
id_ed25519*
id_rsa*
*.pem

# Extracted dev step-ca root cert (regenerated fresh by tls-init on every
# `docker compose up`, see docs/lan-dev-access.md) — never a secret (it's
# a public root cert, not a key) but ephemeral, per-stack-instance output.
/kronos-dev-root-ca.crt

scripts/dev_autoresume/.state/

# Helm dependency-build output (charts/kronos/Chart.yaml's postgresql/
# redis-auth-streams/redis-celery Bitnami dependencies) -- regenerable via
# `helm dependency build charts/kronos/`, not checked in (same convention
# already implicit before Milestone X2b: this repo never committed a
# Chart.lock/charts/ dir even for the pre-existing single postgresql/redis
# dependencies; `make helm-lint`/`helm-template` already required running
# `helm dependency build` first, this was not introduced by this change).
charts/kronos/charts/
charts/kronos/Chart.lock
